In article <17614@usc.edu>, addison@pollux.usc.edu (Richard Addison) writes:
> Well, I spent way too long on one game (i.e. had way too many real gems 
> then I could carry) and I finally left the dungeon with a score of 1512984.

Were these just any old gems?  Have you tried wishing for dilithium crystals,
for instance?  If you save as many of the maze level wishing wands as possible,
and then use them at the very end to wish for (not more than) three at a time,
you can carry all of them, plus your gold.  Of course you'll collapse under
your load, but I'm sure you know how to get out without using the stairs...
You might also try giving the Daemon Prince -MAXINT gold pieces (unless
that bug is fixed...)


